---
description: >-
  Label markup (D710, D711). Plain labels draw <br>, the tags and entities
  and drop other HTML with its text kept; a label wholly in backticks is a
  markdown string; markdown syntax without backticks and List<T> stay as
  written.
---
timeline
  title Label <b>markup</b>
  section <i>Tags</i>
    2002 : <b>bold</b> and <i>italic</i> : <u>under</u> <s>struck</s> : H<sub>2</sub>O x<sup>2</sup>
    2003 : first<br>second : a &lt;b&gt; b &amp; c : <span>span</span> dropped
  section "`**Markdown** string`"
    2004 : "`**bold** and *italic*`" : `*backticks only*`
    2005 : **stays literal** : List<T> stays text
